    authors:
      - family-names: Bartolo Burlo
        given-names: Christian
  - type: article
    title: "Policy Loopholes in Agent Evaluation: When Policy Ambiguity Masquerades as Agent Error"
    notes: "Established the ambiguity thesis this study quantifies."
